 7","arrows":[],"highlights":[{"color":"R","square":"e7"}],"comment":"Checkmate."}],"hints":["Use the knight on f3.","Take the pawn on e5 with that knight.","After Black takes your queen, check on f7 with the bishop, then play a knight move to d5."],"intro":"White to move. Start the trap. Play the whole line. Black will take your queen on the way.","type":"find-move","side":"white"},{"id":"02-legal-mate/legal-mate/3","fen":"rnbqkbnr/pppppppp/8/8/8/8/PPPPPPPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 1","introArrows":[],"introHighlights":[],"moves":[{"san":"e4","uci":"e2e4","fen":"rnbqkbnr/pppppppp/8/8/4P3/8/PPPP1PPP/RNBQKBNR b KQkq - 0 1","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"e5","uci":"e7e5","fen":"rnbqkbnr/pppp1ppp/8/4p3/4P3/8/PPPP1PPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 2","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"Nf3","uci":"g1f3","fen":"rnbqkbnr/pppp1ppp/8/4p3/4P3/5N2/PPPP1PPP/RNBQKB1R b KQkq - 1 2","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"d6","uci":"d7d6","fen":"rnbqkbnr/ppp2ppp/3p4/4p3/4P3/5N2/PPPP1PPP/RNBQKB1R w KQkq - 0 3","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"Bc4","uci":"f1c4","fen":"rnbqkbnr/ppp2ppp/3p4/4p3/2B1P3/5N2/PPPP1PPP/RNBQK2R b KQkq - 1 3","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"Bg4","uci":"c8g4","fen":"rn1qkbnr/ppp2ppp/3p4/4p3/2B1P1b1/5N2/PPPP1PPP/RNBQK2R w KQkq - 2 4","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"Nc3","uci":"b1c3","fen":"rn1qkbnr/ppp2ppp/3p4/4p3/2B1P1b1/2N2N2/PPPP1PPP/R1BQK2R b KQkq - 3 4","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"g6","uci":"g7g6","fen":"rn1qkbnr/ppp2p1p/3p2p1/4p3/2B1P1b1/2N2N2/PPPP1PPP/R1BQK2R w KQkq - 0 5","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"Nxe5","uci":"f3e5","fen":"rn1qkbnr/ppp2p1p/3p2p1/4N3/2B1P1b1/2N5/PPPP1PPP/R1BQK2R b KQkq - 0 5","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"Bxd1","uci":"g4d1","fen":"rn1qkbnr/ppp2p1p/3p2p1/4N3/2B1P3/2N5/PPPP1PPP/R1BbK2R w KQkq - 0 6","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"Bxf7+","uci":"c4f7","fen":"rn1qkbnr/ppp2B1p/3p2p1/4N3/4P3/2N5/PPPP1PPP/R1BbK2R b KQkq - 0 6","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"Ke7","uci":"e8e7","fen":"rn1q1bnr/ppp1kB1p/3p2p1/4N3/4P3/2N5/PPPP1PPP/R1BbK2R w KQ - 1 7","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"Nd5#","uci":"c3d5","fen":"rn1q1bnr/ppp1kB1p/3p2p1/3NN3/4P3/8/PPPP1PPP/R1BbK2R b KQ - 2 7","arrows":[],"highlights":[]}],"hints":["Open with the king pawn, then the kingside knight.","Bishop to c4, then knight to c3.","Take on e5, check on f7, mate on d5."],"intro":"Play the whole trap as White.","type":"line-drill","side":"white"}],"teacherNotes":{"points":["Black's bishop on g4 pins the f3 knight to the queen, so Black thinks the knight is stuck","White moves the knight anyway and offers the queen","After Bxd1 the bishop on c4 and the two knights deliver mate","Count the pieces: Bf7, Ne5 and Nd5 all help","The trap works because Black played 4...g6 instead of 4...Nf6, so no knight guards d5"],"mistakes":["Taking the queen without checking what it allows","Playing Nxe5 when Black has put a knight on f6","Forgetting that the check Bxf7+ comes first"],"questions":["Which black move was the mistake?","Why can the black king not run away at the end?","Which three white pieces help at the end?"]}},{"id":"legal-not-work","title":"When Légal's mate does not work","steps":[{"id":"02-legal-mate/legal-not-work/0","fen":"rnbqkbnr/pppppppp/8/8/8/8/PPPPPPPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 1","introArrows":[],"introHighlights":[],"moves":[{"san":"e4","uci":"e2e4","fen":"rnbqkbnr/pppppppp/8/8/4P3/8/PPPP1PPP/RNBQKBNR b KQkq - 0 1","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"e5","uci":"e7e5","fen":"rnbqkbnr/pppp1ppp/8/4p3/4P3/8/PPPP1PPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 2","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"Nf3","uci":"g1f3","fen":"rnbqkbnr/pppp1ppp/8/4p3/4P3/5N2/PPPP1PPP/RNBQKB1R b KQkq - 1 2","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"d6","uci":"d7d6","fen":"rnbqkbnr/ppp2ppp/3p4/4p3/4P3/5N2/PPPP1PPP/RNBQKB1R w KQkq - 0 3","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"Bc4","uci":"f1c4","fen":"rnbqkbnr/ppp2ppp/3p4/4p3/2B1P3/5N2/PPPP1PPP/RNBQK2R b KQkq - 1 3","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"Bg4","uci":"c8g4","fen":"rn1qkbnr/ppp2ppp/3p4/4p3/2B1P