":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"Nf3","uci":"g1f3","fen":"rnbqkbnr/pppp1ppp/8/4p3/4P3/5N2/PPPP1PPP/RNBQKB1R b KQkq - 1 2","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"d6","uci":"d7d6","fen":"rnbqkbnr/ppp2ppp/3p4/4p3/4P3/5N2/PPPP1PPP/RNBQKB1R w KQkq - 0 3","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"Bc4","uci":"f1c4","fen":"rnbqkbnr/ppp2ppp/3p4/4p3/2B1P3/5N2/PPPP1PPP/RNBQK2R b KQkq - 1 3","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"Bg4","uci":"c8g4","fen":"rn1qkbnr/ppp2ppp/3p4/4p3/2B1P1b1/5N2/PPPP1PPP/RNBQK2R w KQkq - 2 4","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"Nc3","uci":"b1c3","fen":"rn1qkbnr/ppp2ppp/3p4/4p3/2B1P1b1/2N2N2/PPPP1PPP/R1BQK2R b KQkq - 3 4","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"Nf6","uci":"g8f6","fen":"rn1qkb1r/ppp2ppp/3p1n2/4p3/2B1P1b1/2N2N2/PPPP1PPP/R1BQK2R w KQkq - 4 5","arrows":[],"highlights":[]}],"hints":[],"intro":"Without the mate, giving up the queen is just a blunder. A calm developing move like 5.d3 keeps everything safe.","type":"explain"},{"id":"02-legal-mate/legal-not-work/2","fen":"rnbqkbnr/pppppppp/8/8/8/8/PPPPPPPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 1","introArrows":[],"introHighlights":[],"moves":[{"san":"e4","uci":"e2e4","fen":"rnbqkbnr/pppppppp/8/8/4P3/8/PPPP1PPP/RNBQKBNR b KQkq - 0 1","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"e5","uci":"e7e5","fen":"rnbqkbnr/pppp1ppp/8/4p3/4P3/8/PPPP1PPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 2","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"Nf3","uci":"g1f3","fen":"rnbqkbnr/pppp1ppp/8/4p3/4P3/5N2/PPPP1PPP/RNBQKB1R b KQkq - 1 2","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"d6","uci":"d7d6","fen":"rnbqkbnr/ppp2ppp/3p4/4p3/4P3/5N2/PPPP1PPP/RNBQKB1R w KQkq - 0 3","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"Bc4","uci":"f1c4","fen":"rnbqkbnr/ppp2ppp/3p4/4p3/2B1P3/5N2/PPPP1PPP/RNBQK2R b KQkq - 1 3","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"Bg4","uci":"c8g4","fen":"rn1qkbnr/ppp2ppp/3p4/4p3/2B1P1b1/5N2/PPPP1PPP/RNBQK2R w KQkq - 2 4","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"Nc3","uci":"b1c3","fen":"rn1qkbnr/ppp2ppp/3p4/4p3/2B1P1b1/2N2N2/PPPP1PPP/R1BQK2R b KQkq - 3 4","arrows":[],"highlights":[]}],"hints":[],"intro":"The trap works because Black played 4...g6 instead of 4...Nf6, so no knight guards d5. 4...Nf6 guards d5 and spoils the trap.","type":"explain"}],"teacherNotes":{"points":["The trap needs the f6 square to be empty","If Black plays 4...Nf6 the knight guards d5 and the mate is gone","Then 5.Nxe5 would just lose the queen, so do not play it","Without the trap, White simply keeps developing","If Black does not take the queen after 5.Nxe5, White is only a pawn up, so check the position before relying on it"],"mistakes":["Playing Nxe5 on autopilot","Forgetting to check which black pieces guard d5","Being upset when the trap fails instead of playing a good move"],"questions":["Which black piece guards d5?","What should White play instead?","How can you tell the trap will not work?"]}}]},{"id":"03-fried-liver","title":"Trap 2: The Fried Liver attack","lessons":[{"id":"fried-liver","title":"The Fried Liver attack","steps":[{"id":"03-fried-liver/fried-liver/0","fen":"rnbqkbnr/pppppppp/8/8/8/8/PPPPPPPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 1","introArrows":[],"introHighlights":[],"moves":[{"san":"e4","uci":"e2e4","fen":"rnbqkbnr/pppppppp/8/8/4P3/8/PPPP1PPP/RNBQKBNR b KQkq - 0 1","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"e5","uci":"e7e5","fen":"rnbqkbnr/pppp1ppp/8/4p3/4P3/8/PPPP1PPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 2","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"Nf3","uci":"g1f3","fen":"rnbqkbnr/pppp1ppp/8/4p3/4P3/5N2/PPPP1PPP/RNBQKB1R b KQkq - 1 2","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"Nc6","uci":"b8c6","fen":"r1bqkbnr/pppp1ppp/2n5/4p3/4P3/5N2/PPPP1PPP/RNBQKB1R w KQkq - 2 3","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"Bc4","uci":"f1c4","fen":"r1bqkbnr/pppp1ppp/2n5/4p3/2B1P3/5N2/PPPP1PPP/RNBQK2R b KQkq - 3 3","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"Nf6","uci":"g8f6","fen":"r1bqkb1r/pppp1ppp/2n2n2/4p3/2B1P3/5N2/PPPP1PPP/RNBQK2R w KQkq - 4 4","arrows":[],"highlights":[]},{"san":"Ng5","uci":"f3g5","fen":"r1bqkb1r/pppp1ppp/2n2n2/4p1N1/2B1P3/8/PPPP1PPP/RNBQK2R b KQkq - 5 4","arrows":[{"color":"G","from":"g5","to":"f7"},{"color"